    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the full game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Join our discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIGGERS!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/fe4253f6c23ac23a90df91de0c8315fd.poster.avif?t=1724425239\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/fe4253f6c23ac23a90df91de0c8315fd.webm?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/fe4253f6c23ac23a90df91de0c8315fd.mp4?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Recruit a zany cast of diggers to help you reach the core of each planet in this Free to Play, Idle Mining Game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE STORE!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/229d198e797472f5c4356e72c6d36e67.poster.avif?t=1724425239\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/229d198e797472f5c4356e72c6d36e67.webm?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/229d198e797472f5c4356e72c6d36e67.mp4?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Earn rubies by playing the prologue and spend them in the Prologue Shop to unlock new items like character skins in the main Click Click Dig game. The prologue also features an entirely new planet not found in the main game, new skins, new tasks, and more! Play the prologue and the main Click Click Dig in order to unlock everything!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POSITION BONUSES!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/d27a1168199e7e01e4a3cfdf3b95c3ba.poster.avif?t=1724425239\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/d27a1168199e7e01e4a3cfdf3b95c3ba.webm?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/d27a1168199e7e01e4a3cfdf3b95c3ba.mp4?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mine strategically! Position characters to take advantage of powerful stat bonuses. Characters have a stat type that gets boosted when they're on a bonus block. They also apply bonuses to different patterns of blocks. Change the layout to boost the stats you want!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKINS!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/bffe7825f9f894d0707455574f1a41dc.poster.avif?t=1724425239\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/bffe7825f9f894d0707455574f1a41dc.webm?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/bffe7825f9f894d0707455574f1a41dc.mp4?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every digger has multiple unlockable skins. Each skin gives an immediate, permanent bonus just for owning it. There are tons to choose from, so pick your favorite and get digging!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINING!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/442ab321d751cffcef0e8fe96e2c448f.poster.avif?t=1724425239\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/442ab321d751cffcef0e8fe96e2c448f.webm?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030580/extras/442ab321d751cffcef0e8fe96e2c448f.mp4?t=1724425239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every planet has a unique ore to mine. Refine the ore into materials, then use them to craft powerful items that provide stat boosts.<br><br><strong>And much more:</strong><br>\u26cf\ufe0f research digging <br>\u26cf\ufe0f clicker gameplay<br>\u26cf\ufe0f tasks <br>\u26cf\ufe0f incremental progression<br>\u26cf\ufe0f benefactors <br>\u26cf\ufe0f idle progression<br>\u26cf\ufe0f planet shops <br>\u26cf\ufe0f challenge mode <br>\u26cf\ufe0f golden worms <br>\u26cf\ufe0f offline mining modes <br>\u26cf\ufe0f geode prizes <br>\u26cf\ufe0f treasure chests <br>\u26cf\ufe0f big bangs!<br>\u26cf\ufe0f free to play!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN OUR DISCORD</h2>",
